<title>USA: TABLE - Sheridan Healthcare Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Sheridan Healthcare Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Fla. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					   June 30,	   June 30,</p>
<p>					 1997     1996     1997    1996</p>
<p>Net revenue of consolidated and</p>
<p>unconsolidated physician</p>
<p>    practices		    $24,605 $23,475  $47,923 $43,569</p>
<p> Net income			  1,232   1,116    2,420   1,969</p>
<p> Net income per share	     0.18    0.16     0.35    0.30</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>and equivalents outstanding</p>
<p>					 6,934   6,831    6,913   6,577</p>
<p>		   (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Sheridan Healthcare Inc's income tax expense was reduced by a loss carryforward from the prior year for both the second quarter of 1997 and the second quarter of 1996.  On a fully taxable basis, net income per share would have been $0.15 in the second quarter of 1997 and $0.10 in the prior year period.</p>
<p>On a fully taxable basis, net income per share would have been $0.29 for the first six months of 1997 and $0.16 for the prior year period.</p>
